g new, anything different. Dragon Princess VI lusts for a special new playmate...~Who’s This Princess?Of the 6 daughters of the Dragon Queen, the youngest is perhaps the most wild and most dangerous of them all. An absolute beast, driven only by","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:50:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033473","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:46:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1846651706696224","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"💥 Queen of Clubs - Card trading","summary":"The newly announced feature gets deeper, and it's all ready for the 29th!🃏 Trade your cards, get ones you don't have, or get higher-rarity ones for more copies of the same card your client asks for!💥More features are being prepared right now, stay tuned~","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:45:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696224","verified_at":"2026-10-21T04:42:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1846651706695946","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update! (10/20)","summary":"We're listening to you, and this is how fast we work~Frustrated because no needed drink spawns and you don't have an arsenal of items to handle it? Gotchu covered! And I, for one, think it's waaay better like this.Default R-Click skill changed to a \"Snipe\", switching one of the drinks on the Counter with one that's being asked from one of the clients (or a random one if none's asked)Text Speed options added: Normal / Fast / Instant","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:28:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695946","verified_at":"2026-10-21T04:42:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1846651706682578","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"💥 Queen of Clubs - TCG Announcement","summary":"You got that right...Here's the new system I've been secretly working on! The Knight is a big NERD and is into collectible cards, or so it seems!🃏 Collect 100+ cards, buying them from Merchant Princess or getting them from Faun for being a good boyfriend~✨ Holo, Gold, Moonlit cards to chase! Special-looking cards for your collection🎁 All cards can be obtained by playing the game!What will come later on is still pretty much tbd, but will include:Personalized bindersVS ModePromo Cards dropping on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:45:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682578","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1846651706674756","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"What's in the Early Access build","summary":"Two weeks out, and I’m working my ass off in the few days left!The Demo is about to get a lighter, more polished update, and I have to test again and again everything we’re delivering on the 29th... A LOT of stuff all at once!If you don’t know us yet: Queen of Clubs is the second game from the team behind Princess & Conquest. So let’s answer the big questions.12 full ones across Faun (x2), Dragon Princess I (x2), Kobold, Human, Slime, Goblin, Mouse, Rabbit, Finhead and Plant. Plus 3 extra mini s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674756","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1844751498232326","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"♣️ Queen of Clubs WIKI","summary":"Queen of Clubs gets its own Wiki!I've been working on this for a while, and it's finally ready to be shared!A starting guide, a mechanics guide, and a repository for all the items you can obtain in the game, since there's already A LOT of them 💦Live at: princessconquest.com/qoc-wikiCharacters, items, guides, romance progression, hints, rules... all in a single place!If you spot something wrong, or an item that doesn't add up, let me know in the comments or on Discord!Enjoy 🤓","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T19:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232326","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1841579228669465","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"Character Spotlight - 🐲 Dragon Princess I","summary":"Within a fiery cave, a dragon lifts her head as she is counting her hoard. She smells something in the air... the scent of money gone unnoticed. This wouldn’t do at all. All the treasure in the kingdom was hers, and if someone out there is unaware of this fact, it was her duty to rectify that immediately.Who’s This Princess?The main enforcer of order in the Kingdom and the eldest daughter of the Queen, Dragon Princess soon inserts herself into your business, seeing an opportunity to extort- that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T17:00:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1840310314354501","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"Character Spotlight - 🦎 Kobold Princess","summary":"Above the constant clatter of a mine lies a fortress. On its throne, a green-scaled shorty sits, the leader of the operation. Today, Kobold Princess finds herself bored, wishing for a change in the monotony...Who’s This Princess?With your new tavern having inadvertently opened up right near her door, the ever curious Kobold Princess finds herself interested enough to come check things out herself! One of your first potential customers, it’s up to you to charm her and turn her from a curious patr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T16:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314354501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1839676055892894","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"Character Spotlight - 🦌 Faun Princess","summary":"The tavern is quiet, the dim light of the lanterns the only company between shifts as Faun Princess readies for the next evening of bringing the people of the Kingdom together...Who’s This Princess?Here she is, none other than the co-owner of your brand new Tavern, surely soon to be the prime party spot in the entire continent, Faun Princess! Not only has she funded this venture, she is also your main and only barmaid! Not to worry, she has full confidence that you’ll make this place shine. Just","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T16:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892894","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348280-1839041357024597","game_id":"steam-4348280","kind":"announcement","title":"♣ Watch the New Queen of Clubs 